The files under packages/ui/src are Damsko, Grasp's design system
(https://github.com/grasplabs/damsko), installed here as source. They are
not covered by this repository's licence (AGPL-3.0, in LICENSE at its
root) and remain under Damsko's own licence, as it stands at the commit
packages/ui/damsko.json pins:

https://github.com/grasplabs/damsko/blob/2d49f2dfd0fb6b86d78a224253bd788ec6fc9ba7/LICENSE

The fonts in packages/ui/src/styles/fonts are under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1, as their OFL.txt says. A file that follows third-party work
says so in a header line and keeps that work's licence, as Damsko's
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists.
